{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB節目《璀璨之城》昨晚（2日）劇情極度虐心，張曦雯（Kelly）被吳卓羲離婚一幕，強忍眼淚的悲慟模樣獲網民激讚！她哭出「破碎感」的演技令人我見猶憐，更有網民錯重點大讚其高顏值，直呼「三觀都跟著五官走了」，究竟這場戲有多震撼？\n</p>\n<h2>張曦雯高海寧演技格鬥之夜 Kelly喊出新高度</h2>\n<p>昨晚絕對是《璀璨之城》女主角的演技格鬥之夜，高海寧被讚「癲出新高度」，而張曦雯則以一場高顏值的哭戲贏得掌聲。劇情講述Kelly飾演的Kate在經歷推奶奶落樓梯的風波後，最終被老公吳卓羲提出離婚。面對關係終結，她沒有歇斯底里，反而以一種強忍眼淚、平靜又悲慟的表情應對，其我見猶憐的模樣，成功演繹出角色的「破碎感」，演技大獲好評。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚高顏值喊樣 「哭得好美」</h2>\n<p>張曦雯這場極具層次的哭戲，引發網民洗版式討論。不少觀眾對她強忍悲傷的演繹給予高度評價，認為她將角色的無奈與心碎展現得淋漓盡致。網民紛紛留言大讚：「哭得好美」、「場喊戲很不俗」、「害我三觀都跟著五官走了」。留言足證張曦雯憑藉出色的演技與超高顏值，成功讓觀眾完全代入角色的悲痛之中，即使角色犯錯，也讓人忍不住心生憐憫。</p>\n<h2>網民錯重點讚髮質好 Kelly飄逸長髮意外成焦點</h2>\n<p>在全情投入討論張曦雯的「破碎感」哭戲時，有部分網民卻意外「錯重點」，將目光放在了她的頭髮上。在這場沉重的離婚戲中，Kelly一頭長直黑髮顯得格外飄逸柔順，有眼尖的網民就留言大讚她「髮質很好」。這個有趣的觀察為這場虐心戲碼增添了輕鬆的插曲，也側面反映出張曦雯的女神形象深入民心，即使在演繹悲情角色時，其外貌的每個細節都備受關注。</p>\n<h2>網民洗版式討論 封張曦雯為新一代喊戲女王</h2>\n<p>這場戲播出後，網上討論區反應極為熱烈，不少網民都認為這是張曦雯的演技代表作。除了大量讚美，更有觀眾開始深入分析她的表演細節：「真係我見猶憐，睇到好心痛！」、「Kelly演技進步好多，呢幕真係代表作！」、「佢唔係爆喊，但個種心碎嘅感覺仲入心！」、「呢種平靜嘅絕望先係最痛。」、「完全被佢嘅眼神吸引住，好有戲。」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/34_19454462876ae981d59dd79.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/34_19454462876ae981d59dd79.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/36_14602255886ae981db22ccc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/36_14602255886ae981db22ccc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/37_18646129646ae981ddded27.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/37_18646129646ae981ddded27.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/38_5947809296ae981e13e123.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/38_5947809296ae981e13e123.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/39_6595215536ae981e3bcd19.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/39_6595215536ae981e3bcd19.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/41_14939857666ae981e978231.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/41_14939857666ae981e978231.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/43_4437986706ae981eea5677.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/43_4437986706ae981eea5677.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T09:43:19.904046+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1133,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T09:30:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T10:59:17.570502+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T09:39:35.666008+00:00","content_hash":"0d0835479c991ab123ba3580e712e276d0e0c393662c0b8a76ba8162f01534e5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}